== Trivia ==
* The term ''God's flesh'' is a nickname for psychedelic mushrooms.
* In Aztec culture, hallucinogenic mushrooms were eaten during religious ceremonies. The Aztec name for these mushrooms translates to "god's flesh".
* It may also be a reference to Industrial/Experimental Metal band [[wikipedia:Godflesh|Godflesh]].
* The effects of this item are similar to the [[dukenukem:Shrinker (DN3D)|Shrinker]] from Duke Nukem 3D, including the ability to kill shrunken enemies by stepping on them.

